@startuml btrie-bucket-layout
' ============================================================================
' btrie-bucket-layout.puml — the B-trie bucket page (8192 B / 8 KB).
' Source: docs/theory/disk-tries/02-b-trie.md (Askitis & Zobel 2009), § Page Layout.
' Header (fixed) · sorted string-pointer array (grows ↓) · free space ·
' string data area (grows ↑). Drawn as a CONTIGUOUS colored region table (region +
' contents columns) hosted in a floating note; rows share borders (no gaps).
' Full-cell color via Creole |<#hex>| cells.
' Color key:  green  #C8E6C9  char-range identity (range low/high)
'             amber  #FFE0B2  counters + flags (counts, free, pointer count, flags)
'             grey   #ECEFF1  reserved / free-space region
'             blue   #BBDEFB  sorted string-pointer array (binary-search index)
'             l-blue #E3F2FD  string data payload
' ============================================================================
skinparam defaultFontSize 14
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam defaultFontName "DejaVu Sans"
skinparam TitleFontSize 15
skinparam noteFontSize 14
skinparam note {
  BackgroundColor #FFFFFF
  BorderColor #37474F
}

title B-trie bucket — 8 KB page

note as BB
|= region |= contents |
|<#C8E6C9> Range Low · Range High |<#C8E6C9> 1 B each — char range [l, u] |
|<#FFE0B2> String Count · Free Space · Pointer Count |<#FFE0B2> 2 B each — header counters |
|<#FFE0B2> Flags |<#FFE0B2> 1 B — pure / hybrid, … |
|<#ECEFF1> Reserved |<#ECEFF1> 7 B — alignment padding |
|<#BBDEFB> String Pointer Array |<#BBDEFB> grows ↓, sorted offsets (O(log b) binary search) |
|<#ECEFF1> Free Space |<#ECEFF1> unused middle |
|<#E3F2FD> String Data Area |<#E3F2FD> grows ↑, [accumulator (4 B)][bytes][NUL] |
end note

legend bottom
| Color | Region |
|<#C8E6C9>| char-range identity (range low / high) |
|<#FFE0B2>| counters + flags |
|<#ECEFF1>| reserved / free space |
|<#BBDEFB>| sorted string-pointer array |
|<#E3F2FD>| string data payload |
endlegend
@enduml
